        "status": "reviewed",
        "reason": "复用同一期相同SHA并重新对照Nintendo US：CRYMELIGHT与The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time的11月4日、11月5日及Switch 2平台保持不变。"
      },
      {
        "key": "be560f16d9915b5cf3ad2cb1ae354a40b9b93eda",
        "status": "reviewed",
        "reason": "已核验Guardians Encore与Hasbro固定页；Nintendo UK官方DLC页再次确认Stellar Blade Complete Edition 11月5日，保留英国/爱尔兰记录，并依据Nintendo US Coming Soon页新增美国记录。"
      },
      {
        "key": "7f159ca8e135e552f6ede7836ef717e1e0e6ec2a",
        "status": "reviewed",
        "reason": "已核验FM27、Shrek 2、Warhammer Survivors固定详情；完整读取Xbox Wire 10月26日至30日周报及8个10月30日商品页，新增The Abjuration Stand等8条美国Xbox记录。"
      },
      {
        "key": "b494e3ef1dd5ef4d644a7d05dc520832f65a92f0",
        "status": "reviewed",
        "reason": "已核验Queen's Domain Xbox、GRAVHOUNDS、TANUKI与Can 'Em All；Nintendo US Coming Soon页补足Stellar Blade美国区11月5日，原受限项目已处理。"
      },
      {
        "key": "d52ed654ae157bea43fed29b389a3271fdc149ad",
        "status": "reviewed",
        "reason": "Where Winds Meet仍为11月13日内容更新而非新游戏发售；旧Xbox周报在刷新范围外，维持不改日历。"
      },
      {
        "key": "b0cdcb59e5ebc75811403225a223d20f7e1017d5",
        "status": "reviewed",
        "reason": "复用同一期相同SHA并重新对照当前Canonical：Terrible Lizards 10月29日已过刷新起点，17项基线身份与现行记录一致。"
      },
      {
        "key": "1341bf85d2f957bd28b35ac8243da6bf391b62c0",
        "status": "reviewed",
        "reason": "完成剩余基线及候选回执复核；固定Steam与Nintendo项目已与当前Canonical逐项对照，无额外删除。"
      },
      {
        "key": "6385f38b42ea55c5f41641a7baf9ed0a2d914d15",
        "status": "reviewed",
        "reason": "已逐项补查候选一手来源：新增SONIC PICO PARK的Steam、PS5、Xbox/Microsoft Store及日本Switch分区记录；补充ZERO PARADES Xbox/PC记录；Blizzard确认WoW日期不变；Edge of Memories已延期至12月3日、超出刷新范围。"
      },
      {
        "key": "1930ce47773128904a90fd3d1f6b8aa253398035",
        "status": "reviewed",
        "reason": "Hasbro与Godzilla候选继续匹配基线；旧Xbox周报、Where Winds Meet内容更新及已过期Terrible Lizards均已完成归类。"
      }
    ],
